      "id": "msg_sub077_volt_02",
      "hash": "3e620e606c38bb66",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "马志士：Welcome again！\\c\\nWe之间不需要any言语！\\nLet's start！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub077_volt_03",
      "hash": "3e620f606c38bd19",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "马志士：Me还不想give up唷！\\c\\n这种心情还是me来关都以来\\n第一次遇到啊！\\r\\n明天也please再来吧！"
    }
